{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><div class=\"incontent\" id=\"blockcontent\" itemscope=\"\" itemtype=\"http://schema.org/Article\">\n<div class=\"colleft mt-1\" id=\"date\">\n<p class=\"date\" itemprop=\"datePublished\">發布日期   2026年11月13日 16:44 星期五</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"upper\"><p>今日（13日）下午3時許，警方接獲報案，指屯門公路往九龍方向近屯門市廣場有貨車起火，司機已自行離開車輛。消防到場20分鐘內將火救熄，事件中無人受傷。網上片段所見，火勢十分猛烈，全車幾乎被焚毀，僅剩支架，有市民在遠處拍片及觀看。</p></div>\n<div id=\"lower\">\n<div class=\"articlelogin\"><p>運輸署指，因車輛着火，屯門公路（往九龍方向）近屯門市廣場的部份行車線封閉，屯門公路（往九龍方向）通往屯發路的支路全綫已封閉，上址交通擠塞。</p></div><p>相關字詞﹕汽車着火 </p> </div>\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T09:19:15.034261+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":222,"images":0,"source":"明報 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T08:44:21+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T14:40:03.093064+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T09:12:23.760669+00:00","content_hash":"151db21d6a1b1f83951359e810c9975ed6fcfb9d795a0f097e4073ef85c30ccd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}